  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bhutan - Institutional Strengthening of Ministry of Labor and Human Resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Ministry of Labor and Human Recources (MoLHR) to facilitate employment and labor market access for the Bhutanese youth. To this end, the project would include three components: 1. Development of a National Employment Policy and Review of Occupational Health and Safety Regulations. 2. Introduction of innovative skills development training in close coordination with the private sector. 3. Building the capacity of the MoLHR&apos;s regional offices to promote employment through labor services. The objective of the proposed grant is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Ministry of Labour and Human Resources (MoLHR) to facilitate employment and labor market entry of Bhutanese youth. This would consist of the following sub-components:  1. Developing a National Employment Policy and Reviewing of Occupational Health and Safety regulations.  2. Development of innovative Public Private Partnerships (PPP) for skills development training for disadvantaged youth.  3. Building the capacity of Regional Labour and Employment offices to promote employment and labor services.</narrative>
  </description>
